    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are thrilled to bring to the market this Well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached home in excellent condition, ideally located in the popular residential area of Manor Grove, Thornbury, Rochestown.\r\nThis attractive property offers comfortable and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking for a well-located home overlooking a large green.\r\nThe property is presented in superb repair and provides bright, practical living accommodation, including a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living room and a well-appointed kitchen/dining area as well as large utility and study or optional bedroom or office. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, together with a family bathroom.\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a large drive with ample off street parking  and a rear garden providing a pleasant outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining with a wired & insulated outdoor office or gym.\r\nSituated in the established and sought-after Manor Grove/Thornbury area of Rochestown, the property is conveniently positioned close to local schools, shops, public transport and a range of amenities. The location also provides easy access to Cork City and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: Hallway: - \r\n Laminate flooring, New carpet on stairs and freshly painted hallway.\r\n\r\nLiving room: - 4.7m x 3.7m \r\nSolid wood flooring, marble surround fire place, large window overlooking green, double doors to the kitchen.\r\n\r\nPlayroom/office/bedroom 4 - 4.8m x 2.4m \r\nLaminate flooring with built in window seat and large window overlooking green.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining : - 5.1m x 3.6m \r\nTile flooring, solid wood floor and eye level Kitchen units, over the counter tiles, integrated oven and hob, sink & drainer with double doors to the living room and French doors to back garden.\n\r\n\r\nUtility room: - 3.0m x 2.7m \r\nTile flooring, sink and drainer, floor and eye level units, plumbed for washer dryer, door to back garden.  \r\n\r\nFirst floor  Bedroom 1: - 4.0m x 3.0m \r\nDouble bedroom to the front of the house with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom. 2 - 3.0m x 2.7m \r\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the house with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: - 3.0m x 2.3m \r\nSingle bedroom to the front of the property with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nMain bathroom - \r\nFloor and wall tiles, shower over the bath,wc, whb. \r\n\r\nShed - 3.5m x 2.8m \r\nWired and insulated. \r\n\r\n"
      },
